  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Among Southern Border immortals attacking Heavenly Court’s holy burial forest, Ba Xiong asks Lord Yi Hao Fang to support him. Yi Hao Fang looks toward Ba clan’s first supreme elder Ba Shi Ba, and after that nod uses his method on Ba Xiong. Narration states that his reinforcement method is not just famous in Southern Border, but renowned in the world. Ba Xiong feels unparalleled strength flow into his body, turns into a giant, and charges the forest core.",
      "chapters": [
        1706
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "fac_ba_clan",
        "char_ba_shi_ba"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He has wings on his back.",
      "chapters": [
        1709
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Chen Yi and Bai Cang Shui leave the formation, wings on Yi Hao Fang’s back wave and countless arrows shoot out. The rain pierces Bai Cang Shui’s waves and approaches her and Chen Yi, then only shakes trees and drops leaves when it hits Chen Yi’s phantom forest.",
      "chapters": [
        1709
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "arrow-rain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chen_yi",
        "char_bai_cang_shui"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A song stops the battlefield. After it ends, Yi Hao Fang asks what song it is. A rank eight Gu Immortal in a red and white robe walks out of the formation, smiles, and says it is his newly created destiny song. It is Feng Jiu Ge.",
      "chapters": [
        1726
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "question-after-the-song",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_feng_jiu_ge"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yi Hao Fang says they need to cooperate with the outside to destroy the formation, leave the outside to unlimited wind, and find the weak point from inside. He cultivates transformation path. Wu Yong keeps him outside with Ba Shi Ba, treating the two as rank eights posted against Heavenly Court reinforcements.",
      "chapters": [
        1727
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cultivation-rank",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_yong"
      ]
    }
  ],
